## Spec files

Each domain has a `specs/<domain>.md` with the detailed feature inventory.
Rows in the spec are the source of truth; this file aggregates their counts.

## How to update

1. Add/update rows in `specs/<domain>.md` (❌ → ✅ when a case is automated)
2. Run `python scripts/coverage_report.py`
3. Commit the updated COVERAGE.md alongside the test change

